SUMMARY:Exit Only: WEMBLEY PARK STATION: Saturday 26 September\, between 
 2130 and 2225\, the station will be busy due to concerts at Wembley 
 Stadium. The Bridge Road entrance will be exit only until the queue to 
 enter the station clears. Entry to the station\, including step-free 
 access via lift\, will be via Olympic Way. Please allow extra time for 
 your journey
END:VEVENT
